the creature arena:
the creature arena, or the hunt is also another type of arena, however it is very different from the arena as well as the melee arena. in the creature arena, your goal is to kill a creature called the eoraptor as fast as you can, for whoever kills this creature first wins it all.
killing other players is also allowed. you can either kill everybody else first in order to be the only one receiving a shot at the creature, or you can team up with others to weaken the creature first. the use of offencive spells, like the other two arenas is not allowed in the hunt, similarly the defencive spells are allowed.
to participate in the hunt, you must type /hunt in the chat box, or press the alt and c keys at the same time. after joining the waiting area you must wait for the hunt to start. as soon as the hunt starts you are free to work towards your goal, which is to kill the eoraptor.